[{"title":"病中偶成","author":"陈起","text":"平生谨樽酒，投老更齐圣。\n优游接嘉宾，能使百忧屏。\n可怜陶士行，饮少亦致病。\n丰下改旧容，浮采满青镜。\n升降气失常，医经云上盛。\n亟试黄昏汤，要期勿药庆。\n朝来觉清爽，临窗发幽咏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真静馈新茶菰乾黄独乳酪约葵窗适安共享适安不赴葵窗诗来道谢次韵答之兼呈真静适安","author":"陈起","text":"千载靖节翁，秫向公田种。\n万钟于我何，肯恋五斗俸。\n长歌归去来，田园聊自奉。\n高蹈世莫俦，器局小管仲。\n嗟余昧于时，退思心每痛。\n世人不我知，小畦亲抱瓮。\n唯有竹宫仙，时复致一供。\n四清山中珍，凡目为之动。\n黄独前未识，勿诮仲宣憃。\n春茗摘新芽，秋菰怀旧葑。\n江南贵乳酪，此意兼金重。\n得君同下箸，诗来再三讽。\n韵意两相高，文史叹足用。\n续貂愧狗尾，敢与贤者共。\n语奚较工拙，年来此心纵。\n软饱黑甜馀，无复春草梦。\n可人招不来，属篇亟持送。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄汪起潜签判","author":"陈起","text":"飞云起伏龙，大鹏运以风。\n风云一朝会，前塞今乃通。\n敛翼贤景略，时哉使其逢。\n腰钱与骑鹤，事或有适同。\n青门瓜吹香，绿水莲泛红。\n人物王谢家，风雅眼底空。\n参画耸台府，宜护碧纱笼。\n鄱江万折东，独鹗摩苍穹。\n浮图快一掷，归骑先宾鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题当湖隐渌亭","author":"陈起","text":"曲径一亭幽，三十六水聚。\n檐影接波光，蝉声入秋思。\n开薸静看云，爱月懒种树。\n濠上意如何，疏钟烟外寺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望晓","author":"陈起","text":"要知筋力衰多少，一觉才回常了了。\n邻钟无奈五更何，望断窗纱不能晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答赵章泉","author":"陈起","text":"新诗将远意，千里附文鳞。\n清响蝉嘘露，高閒鹤卧云。\n但知耕野水，不暇问朝绅。\n剩欲陪颜笑，凄凉吴楚分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答熟庵","author":"陈起","text":"昨宵约月临西池，冰蟾不至鹑火飞。\n归来一室白于昼，乃是新诗光陆离。\n当年应剖琼蚌腹，不然何以明于烛。\n细窥字字欲走盘，三复庵名悟圆熟。\n一片情田万古耕，有年能得几书经。\n小疵终是未全稔，孰若先生耨穫精。\n南窗寄傲遂初欲，移石畦兰更纫菊。\n茶烟细杂玉炉沉，研影净涵金井渌。\n林下今才见一人，却疑图任思旧臣。\n自昔东山岂终隐，似闻鸾诏下苍旻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楷书歌赠人","author":"陈起","text":"大哉易画包牺生，鸟迹科斗相继永。\n六体中间亦湮昧，次仲楷到钟王精。\n献捷之表最近古，庄正如持干戚舞。\n黄庭字字能通神，强弓千挽筋力均。\n宝书遥遥名不朽，正法欧虞远能守。\n后生不作诸老亡，睹君笔法得仙手。\n况君变格睨逸少，秋霁凭高森晚照。\n须知伯英到极工，中存楷则方入妙。\n我初不识君，见君石上文。\n从今便著青眼视，王谢庭前佳子弟。\n才能素所喜，喜极为君歌。\n君今弱冠不可那，更后十年当君何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静江商宰书来且索鄙语要道其冰雪相看之意古调代书","author":"陈起","text":"连墙不通问，千里乃寄音。\n平生于缔交，淡泊味最深。\n吴山青插天，应同碧玉簪。\n尚怜风马牛，暌若商与参。\n一声南来雁，西风又相寻。\n君其念衰朽，余亦怀瑶林。\n一廉了官事，吟外时鸣琴。\n识量万顷陂，文华宝南金。\n向来唐相璟，疑事问崔琳。\n诸台贵得贤，而肯舍此琛。\n会晤喜有期，宽此离索襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"履斋先生下颁参附往体以谢","author":"陈起","text":"有客号奚毒，西来自赤水。\n外负炎炎气，内存温粹美。\n当年杨天惠，夸大不绝齿。\n解后段氏子，即之殊可喜。\n却邪乃素心，调中古无比。\n世仰大医王，民瘼咨朝市。\n二子愿托身，赴汤任驱使。\n兴怜维摩老，遣前护衰毁。\n病魔亟退舍，怡然得安垒。\n缅想蓄牛溲，陋哉子韩子。\n既非瞑眩剂，厥疾无瘳理。\n一念卫生恩，百拜额加子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题建溪刘希和吟趣园","author":"陈起","text":"佳气满吴洲，琅琅谪仙句。\n当其傲云月，风流良可慕。\n寂寥数百载，何人踵逸步。\n建溪有刘侯，于吟契其趣。\n是知建与吴，妙处同一悟。\n水石巧萦纡，烟云互吞吐。\n花光时变眩，山色无旦暮。\n物物可供吟，先为梅花赋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题适安清湖寓居","author":"陈起","text":"薰风轩槛晓晴开，郁郁桐阴手自栽。\n二水合流当户过，一山分影入楼来。\n琴逢良夜时挥弄，诗欲名家巧剪裁。\n可羡一廛安所适，纷纷车马汩黄埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言","author":"陈起","text":"破窗有子书鸦，杜门无客尝茶。\n春事应怜幽独，隔墙飞过杨花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六言简耘业","author":"陈起","text":"露湿萤光愈炽，月斜蛩韵尤清。\n微物得时若此，人生可不求名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题玉泉画像次来轴韵","author":"陈起","text":"鹿随寒策穿云，解后灵峰时节。\n含毫谁貌闲情，莫尽胸中风月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18365,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈起","text":"秋雨梧桐皇子府，春风杨柳相公桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18366,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其八","author":"陈造","text":"酒边先起未须扶，犹听槌床击唾壶。\n风月撩人成不寝，隔墙却拟应歌呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18367,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其七","author":"陈造","text":"人间雨恨更云愁，月殿仙娥替汝羞。\n诗酹此觞坚后约，与人晴霁作中秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18368,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其六","author":"陈造","text":"客间那不笑翁痴，酒处犹须古锦为。\n不道诗成还玉雪，聊凭一解桂娥颐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18369,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其五","author":"陈造","text":"衰怀对客便超然，病骨枝梧胜去年。\n未作槌腰摩腹想，尚堪渌蚁翠蛾前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18370,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其四","author":"陈造","text":"露颗零空冱欲冰，风姨收尽晚林声。\n金波冷浸山河影，直为高阳酒伴明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18371,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"朋来济济尽嘉宾，饮兴翩翩笑语真。\n绝胜谪仙邀月醉，当时和影祇三人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18372,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"谢兰潘璧少年场，玉麈金罍度夜央。\n老子遽能忘此兴，且容投杖唤胡床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18373,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十二日夜偕客赏木犀八首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"冰蟾蜚下一天霜，领略岩花旖旎香。\n我亦小园清绝处，与君同命醉为乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18374,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十五夜再次赵帅韵","author":"陈造","text":"嘉宾饮兴未阑残，却倩纤纤奉雪团。\n一笑举杯邀月姊，为渠聊贷广寒寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其七","author":"陈造","text":"右史文章海倒流，淮南异政古人俦。\n亲闻抚几推双美，独向夫君放一头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其八","author":"陈造","text":"楚城巉绝控穷边，楚俗伤弓未帖然。\n一自并州烦李绩，不闻贵买渡江船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其三","author":"陈造","text":"三傍清淮酹酒杯，四年霜鬓犯风埃。\n即今定被淮人笑，又见衰翁禄遫来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其一","author":"陈造","text":"雨馀凉气晓风沨，却爱朝阳一抹红。\n照影芙蕖天与远，可能犹恨打头风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其五","author":"陈造","text":"诗伯于今第一流，清篇传诵到鳌头。\n共推句法源流远，伯仲夔州只楚州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其四","author":"陈造","text":"追寻名胜剩留年，白首犹参五字禅。\n寄语蜚廉亟回驭，拟凌风去访诗仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其九","author":"陈造","text":"里社过逢起醉眠，行人鱼稻不论钱。\n欲知劝课功多少，地覆黄云远接天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其二","author":"陈造","text":"忍馋留得可羹鱼，微沫相濡未就枯。\n自解柳枝投渌水，劳生与汝各江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其六","author":"陈造","text":"密受眉山一印传，斯文千载石林仙。\n使君酷似牢之舅，更喜鸾胶续此弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句呈章茂深安抚 其十","author":"陈造","text":"经纶术业向来优，千骑东方恐未俦。\n他日应携报恩子，还朝看拜富民侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其七","author":"陈造","text":"从公日日醉中归，插鬓长分最好枝。\n旧约何如趁新约，浪言灯夕胜花时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18386,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其一","author":"陈造","text":"柳堤阴里放船开，识面人家首屡回。\n莫讶春阳浮大宅，新陪诗伯唱酬来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18387,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其十","author":"陈造","text":"每上平山把酒卮，海鸿泉骥满乌丝。\n风流人物诗书帅，万字千钟更属谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18388,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其六","author":"陈造","text":"醉中记得新翻谱，土苴梁州笑石州。\n火急归来传好事，为渠一洗世间愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18389,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其四","author":"陈造","text":"金田碧野把杯前，飞骑鸣弰簉玳筵。\n五百年来逢此乐，府公今续谪仙弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18390,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其三","author":"陈造","text":"款陪仙伯燕池亭，不但新诗老眼明。\n鼓吹激天飞鸟堕，旌幢点水睡龙惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18391,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其九","author":"陈造","text":"讼户无声日燕閒，驱驰风月笑谭间。\n自今玉海添新集，与继当年大小山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18392,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其八","author":"陈造","text":"子骏福星方久照，渔阳竹马省相迎。\n他时薤水休重问，市虎晨羊各用情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18393,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十绝句寄赵帅 其五","author":"陈造","text":"豪竹哀丝荐玉觞，羽衣仙袂俨分行。\n酡颜一为东君笑，媚白妖红不敢芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18394,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次看字韵二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"明年屈指春来早，定是元宵不苦寒。\n十里珠帘火城夜，客来应许醉中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18395,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次看字韵二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"谁扶璧月上天端，雪魄扬辉桂影寒。\n照见群仙拥仙伯，嫦娥定复转头看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次铦朴翁韵四首 其四","author":"陈造","text":"几向西湖舣画桡，冰奁俨受众峰朝。\n即今去雁将清梦，飞下长桥更短桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次铦朴翁韵四首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"婪酣贵宦鲛绡帐，赑屃功名泊浪沙。\n谁似朴翁随分过，曹溪水煮赵州茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次铦朴翁韵四首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"闻为诗魔掩贝多，辞源衮衮倒洪河。\n遥知传诵日千纸，淇上高唐无善歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次铦朴翁韵四首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"僧床正听晓楼钟，客棹方占上水风。\n喧静未须岐出处，与渠心事各冥鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"愁为离群老不禁，诗来深得故人心。\n自摩病眼添沈炷，满纸晶荧玩碎金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其二","author":"陈造","text":"欢意长随夜漏长，隆宽尽贷酒边狂。\n东归祇有南窗梦，夜夜掀髯锦瑟傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其七","author":"陈造","text":"公家昆季尽时贤，叔也骅骝拟度前。\n书谂亲庭先静退，至今文采照林泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其九","author":"陈造","text":"故人折柳送东辕，不羡当年李郭船。\n囊锦鸱夷有供给，自疑身是御风仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其五","author":"陈造","text":"福地常披十幅图，仙翁隐处玉为壶。\n九华山侧双峰下，还许侬分半席无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其三","author":"陈造","text":"八月襄城暑始回，水仙争趁玉梅开。\n当时二物知天意，共报公家福鼎来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其十","author":"陈造","text":"帝所乡关等是家，奚囊纳纳尽天葩。\n西湖久待公题品，莫遣波神妒九华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其四","author":"陈造","text":"芳信飞来自月宫，月中桂茂劣能容。\n素娥封殖非无意，准拟公家不尽供。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其一","author":"陈造","text":"白璧明玑每堕前，续貂辄复耸双肩。\n一从归作漳滨卧，不寄诗筒恰五年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口号十首呈程殿撰 其六","author":"陈造","text":"郎君衮绣照鸳行，诗老时须住帝乡。\n即见翘材辟新馆，预应绿野敞深堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18410,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马援","author":"陈造","text":"朱勃风标似可亲，文渊竟作白头新。\n平时轻侮知何事，辨雪冤诬独此人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18411,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不寐二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"追思可乐是丁年，日力孳孳有食眠。\n头触屏风祇灯后，慈亲笑劝掩陈编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18412,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不寐二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"改遍年来所著书，依然幽梦隔华胥。\n寒更何与衰翁事，数到琤摐杀点馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18413,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"苦吟添满镜中丝，课效全输博塞嬉。\n改就新诗哦百过，浪言儿辈不须知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18414,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"壮年肤骨已清臞，老去支离转不如。\n二十七年扶病过，半缘耽酒半耽书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18415,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书南柯太守曲后二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"竹叶舟前客念家，慈云瓮里事如麻。\n而今不笑檀槐战，笑汝研桑了岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18416,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书南柯太守曲后二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"门前车马竞飞驰，等是槐安未寐时。\n何似阿怜歌此曲，一卮随分得伸眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18417,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书城北尼庵二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"诸郎弓力胜黄间，中戟穿杨气貌闲。\n乐府新传杀胡谶，看君飞矢下阴山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18418,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书城北尼庵二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"小摇蛇影鸟惊堕，已落背毛牛自如。\n瞢欲分朋惭老病，与渠甘作典筹舒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18419,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予七十赵监税见贺以诗次韵","author":"陈造","text":"平生烛之武，况已雪髯翁。\n誉我犹时用，君言恐未公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18420,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕遣怀二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"平世计功须壮岁，异时敌己尽亨涂。\n鬓须久已沾青女，穷达何劳问紫姑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18421,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]